+- Moving a task takes it out of its project, so it needs the same right as
+  deleting: a manager of the source project (contributors and org admins get
+  403). The actor must also be able to write to the destination project
+  (contributor or manager, not archived; not readable → 404, viewer → 403,
+  archived → 409). The move is refused with 400 if the task's assignee is not
